  39:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_exti.c ****     (+) When set in interrupt mode, configurable Exti lines have two different
  40:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_exti.c ****         interrupts pending registers which allow to distinguish which transition
  41:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_exti.c ****         occurs:
  42:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Rising edge pending interrupt
  43:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Falling
